  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "librarian-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": -200,
      "width": 3980,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "# Current Activation Paths: Present-Day UI, Folders, Workflows, MCP & Staging (d9435e1)\n**Symptom:** MCP agents hit contribute caps, 0 folder MCP tools, curate process_approved refusals, 150s Ask waits, F-09 form wipes, and dropped workflow results (app.js:8472).\n**Root cause:** Document verified d9435e1 UI, separate Folder review/Geo apply, the /api/folders/sources queue bridge, the deep-read-staged workflow, MCP/Broker and batch paths without retrofitting the historical trace.\nLanes are actors; red arrows are extensions (numbered); red ends are ways the use case ends without success; orange cards call another use case. Generated from `librarian-current-activation.spec.yaml`."
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-s",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 70,
      "text": "● start",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
