      "x": 1240,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "d9435e1 current-state map; separates Folder review/Geo apply from Source intake, connects them only via /api/folders/sources, and preserves historical ingestion.canvas."
    },
